.worktrees/
.superpowers/
/build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The compiled command, named as the module's main package path. `go build
# ./cmd/mosdns-cdnctl` writes it into the working directory, and without this an
# accidental build leaves a 29MB binary in `git status` where it reads as a change
# somebody meant to make. The packaging build writes into /build/ and is unaffected.
/mosdns-cdnctl
